<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Unduh Aplikasi Bilik Suara DOSMAN — Khusus Komputer Bilik</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .download-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 40px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .btn-download-big {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #047857);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .btn-download-big:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #065f46);
    }
    .step-box {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: left;
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .step-number {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="app-container" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 95vh; padding: 24px 16px;">
    <div class="download-card">

      <!-- Header & Logo -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <div class="brand-logo" style="margin: 0 auto 14px auto; width: 80px; height: 80px; padding: 4px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
          <img src="/assets/logo_dosman.jpg" alt="Logo SMAN 1 Gianyar">
        </div>
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #e0e7ff; color: #4338ca; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
          🛡️ Halaman Khusus Panitia / Proktor
        </div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">
          Aplikasi Bilik Suara DOSMAN
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;">
          E-Voting OSIS SMAN 1 Gianyar &middot; Client Khusus Komputer Bilik Suara
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Badges -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <span style="background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: #334155; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;">
          💻 Kompatibel: Windows 8, 8.1, 10, &amp; 11 (64-Bit)
        </span>
        <span style="background: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #fde68a; color: #b45309; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;">
          📦 Format: .RAR Portable (Siap Pakai)
        </span>
        <span style="background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; color: #065f46; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;">
          🔒 Kiosk Mode Locked
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Download Button -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
        <a href="/download/kiosk-app" class="btn-download-big" id="downloadBtn">
          <svg style="width: 24px; height: 24px;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"/>
          </svg>
          UNDUH APLIKASI WINDOWS (.RAR)
        </a>
        <p style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 8px; font-weight: 600;">
          Ukuran Berkas: &plusmn; 76.7 MB &middot; Versi Standar Bilik Suara 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Panduan Singkat -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: left;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <span>📋</span> Langkah Penggunaan di PC Bilik Suara:
        </h3>

        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;">
            <strong>Ekstrak Berkas RAR:</strong> Salin file <code style="background: #e2e8f0; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;">Bilik-Suara-DOSMAN-Windows.rar</code> ke flashdisk / komputer bilik suara, lalu ekstrak menggunakan WinRAR atau 7-Zip.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;">
            <strong>Buka Aplikasi:</strong> Klik ganda pada file <strong>Bilik Suara (Klik 2x Untuk Mulai).bat</strong> atau <strong>Bilik Suara DOSMAN.exe</strong>.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-box">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;">
            <strong>Layar Penuh Terkunci:</strong> Aplikasi akan otomatis terbuka fullscreen tanpa address bar. Pemilih siap melakukan login dan voting secara rahasia.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-box" style="background: #fffbeb; border-color: #fde68a;">
          <div class="step-number" style="background: #d97706;">🔑</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #92400e; line-height: 1.4;">
            <strong>Tombol Keluar Darurat (Panitia):</strong> Tekan kombinasi tombol <strong>Ctrl + Shift + Q</strong> (atau <strong>Alt + F4</strong>) di keyboard untuk menutup aplikasi.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Link Back -->
      <div style="border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
        <span>SMAN 1 Gianyar &middot; Widya Wahana Bhakti</span>
        <a href="/login" style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;">Ke Halaman Login &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
